              "fill": "$white80",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Fields keep true background blur (64 pt), a 60% dark glass tint and a 25% white edge. Place them over the page’s colored backdrop or imagery so softened shapes remain visible at their edges. The surrounding color provides contrast; the text stays sharp.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
