              "type": "text",
              "id": "nGpo8",
              "name": "Specification",
              "fill": "$white80",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Screen content: fade in with an 8 pt upward settle over 180–220 ms. Buttons: brief pressed-state feedback. Keep native bottom-sheet motion. Reduce Motion: show the final state immediately; no stagger on recycled list cells.",
